# Reproducible Run Instructions

I ran these commands from the repository root.

## Local web application

```bash
make docker-build
make docker-run
make docker-test
```

I opened <http://localhost:8839> and stopped the container when I finished.

```bash
make docker-stop
```

## Planner, Reviewer and Finalizer

```bash
ollama serve
ollama pull qwen3:8b
python3.12 agents_demo.py --input-file reports/hw01/cases/nondeterminism_input.json --model qwen3:8b --temperature 0.0
```

## Non-determinism experiment

```bash
make experiment
```

## Token-accounting client

```bash
make run-client
python3.12 scripts/run_five_turn_demo.py
```

## Verification

```bash
make verify-hw01
```

## AWS ECS deployment and cleanup

```bash
CONFIRM_DEPLOY=yes ./aws/deploy.sh
CONFIRM_CLEANUP=yes ./aws/cleanup.sh
```
